# The GSI product RRO declares a HIDL fingerprint sensor (0:2:15), which forces
# FingerprintService into HIDL mode although the Oplus HAL is AIDL-only.
# Bind an identical RRO whose config_biometric_sensors is empty over it before
# zygote starts. vendor_init may not mount on /system, so use the userdebug su
# domain through an exec service, which runs in the default mount namespace.
on post-fs-data
    exec u:r:su:s0 root root -- /system/bin/mount -o bind /vendor/overlay/rmx3943-fingerprint-rro.bin /system/product/overlay/framework-res__lineage_gsi_arm64_gN__auto_generated_rro_product.apk
